\ The same uncompilable method{ body under strict interpreter-free AOT. With no
\ interpreter to run the body and no runtime image to carry it, the build fails
\ with a method-body diagnostic that points at --emit-runtime-image.

counter: virtual{ fixnum } ;
bump:    generic ( c -- n ) [ drop -1 ] ;
bump:    method{ counter } [ drop helper: [ 7 ] ; helper ] ;

0 >counter bump drop
